	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus in domino Iesu.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p8093">Hercules</persName> te salvere iubet, me autem rogavit, ut tibi nota facerem<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>, quae nuper in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> acciderunt.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Arx quaedam est sive, ut <placeName ref="l834">Itali</placeName> aiunt, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>fortalicium inexpugnabile inter <persName ref="p8088">Regium</persName> et <persName>Mutinam</persName>, quae opida sunt <persName>du<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>cis Ferrarie</persName>, situm, quod ipse dux maxima cura custodiri semper voluit, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>a <placeName ref="l306">Mediolano</placeName> distans miliaribus <placeName ref="l822">Germanicis</placeName> viginti vel circa.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dux <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><persName>Florentinus</persName> consentiente papa, quoniam<note type="misc">qm</note> et ipse est de domo Medica, huius<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>modi arcem cum maximo omnium stupore proditione facta ab eo, qui <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>loci illius curam habebat, cepit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Indicat autem <persName ref="p8093">Hercules</persName> bellorum peritus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>rem hanc <placeName ref="l834">Italie</placeName> magnorum motuum causam fore; nam <placeName ref="l522">Venetis</placeName>, qui <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>cum <placeName ref="l150">Ferrariensi</placeName> duce confederati sunt, magno detrimento erit, nedum ipsi <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>duci.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nam facile erit <persName ref="p8088">Regium</persName> et Mutinam aggredi et ab inimicis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>capi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nosti ipsum ducem quotannis ob eas civitates pendere <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>pape tributum magnum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Si hec duo opida caperentur, <placeName ref="l522">Venetis</placeName> magn<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>a pericula imminerent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Estimat autem <persName ref="p8093">Hercules</persName> id consentiente <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>etiam <persName ref="p18575">Philippo</persName>, <placeName ref="l875">Hispaniarum</placeName> rege, qui <placeName ref="l522">Venetis</placeName> infensus est, factum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>fuisse, merces digna profecto cardinali <placeName ref="l150">Ferrariensi</placeName>, qui antichristi <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> partes tuetur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Diebus praeteritis aliquot armatorum milia <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nomine pape, que Avenionem mittenda erant, <placeName ref="l306">Mediolano</placeName>, ubi con<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>gregata erant, discesserunt <placeName ref="l55">Bononiam</placeName> versus, nonnulli dicebant ma<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>re versus iter arripuisse.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Videmus nunc, quid machinate sint vulpes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Hoc te scire voluimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l93">Clavene</placeName> 4. augusti 1562.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/><persName ref="p2019">Augustinus Mainardus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Eximio viro domi<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>no <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabricio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensi</placeName> pastori, semper observando.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curie</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Unter dem Text Zusatz von <persName ref="p8009">Fabricius</persName> (an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>):]</note>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Glychs ist h. <persName ref="p8114">Balinket</persName> ouch von <placeName ref="l36">P<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ergama</placeName> zuͦgeschriben und die veste genennt, namlich <placeName>Rübera</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Bald ist anders schryben ouch dodannen <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>kommen, es sölle nitt syn, und züche <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>des baapst volckh uff <placeName ref="l1121">Genuam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>In bellis multa inania; sed mirum, quis <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>tales rumores serat aut in quem finem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Omnes, qui ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> veniunt, constanter <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>affirman[t] <placeName>Riberam</placeName> proditione captam.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Nun<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>c qu<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>id verum, quid vanum sit, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>difficile dictu e<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>st.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>